{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22940","headline":"得行简书闻欲下峡先以诗寄 · 白居易","name":"得行简书闻欲下峡先以诗寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝来又得东川信，欲取春初发梓州。\n书报九江闻暂喜，路经三峡想还愁。\n潇湘瘴雾加餐饭，灩澦惊波稳泊舟。\n欲寄两行迎尔泪，长江不肯向西流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}